            color: COLORS.textMuted,
            fontWeight: 400,
            letterSpacing: "-0.005em",
            opacity: subIn,
            transform: `translateY(${interpolate(subIn, [0, 1], [12, 0])}px)`,
            marginTop: 12,
          }}
        >
          Show me how to set it up →
